    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psycho-Sleuth</strong> is a <strong>mystery deduction game</strong> that fuses classic whodunit elements with <strong>cognitive distortion mechanics</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this deadly game of &quot;kill without being caught,&quot; every murder is reshaped through the lens of bizarre mental disorders. Logic twists, truth warps\u2014only your reasoning can restore order.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Twisted Trial of God</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious cult named <i>Li</i> has seized control of the world.<br>Their cruel trial is simple: <strong>commit murder without being exposed, and you shall ascend to godhood.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 &quot;Afflicted Ones&quot; are summoned\u2014individuals burdened with rare cognitive disorders that spread their warped perceptions to others, creating murder scenes that defy reason:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OCD</strong> forces absolute truth\u2014no one can lie</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spatial neglect</strong> erases evidence from the left side of reality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prosopagnosia</strong> blurs every face into anonymity</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you untangle these cognitive illusions and expose the true mastermind?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432860/extras/d9269ac2c55b971109bf4c7a062c5018.avif?t=1752829356\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intense and Fast-Paced Debate Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter <strong>Debate Mode</strong>, where you'll rapidly judge every statement:<br>Will you accept their words, or strike back with the right clue?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle tests your logic, instincts, and time management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432860/extras/d2ad4c0f7f82e607e4619f59d55cc7e4.poster.avif?t=1752829356\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432860/extras/d2ad4c0f7f82e607e4619f59d55cc7e4.webm?t=1752829356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432860/extras/d2ad4c0f7f82e607e4619f59d55cc7e4.mp4?t=1752829356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Murders Twisted by Cognitive Disorders</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Psycho-Sleuth</i>, crime scenes are not what they seem.<br>Witness bodies without faces, missing evidence, and spaces erased by perception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That corpse with severed limbs\u2014was it murder?<br>Or did they fall victim to their own &quot;Alien Limb Syndrome&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432860/extras/945c572a3a6e442f00b46592419d54a2.poster.avif?t=1752829356\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432860/extras/945c572a3a6e442f00b46592419d54a2.webm?t=1752829356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432860/extras/945c572a3a6e442f00b46592419d54a2.mp4?t=1752829356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >13 Unique Afflicted Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character bears a distinct disorder and a unique &quot;Afflicted Power.&quot;<br>Understanding their minds is key to uncovering their crimes and motives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432860/extras/01f0074c0e8f9a564317596a53e12ae2.poster.avif?t=1752829356\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432860/extras/01f0074c0e8f9a564317596a53e12ae2.webm?t=1752829356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432860/extras/01f0074c0e8f9a564317596a53e12ae2.mp4?t=1752829356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Live2D Animations &amp; Stunning CG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed Live2D portraits bring every emotional nuance to life,<br>while high-quality CG sets the stage for tense interrogations and shocking punishments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432860/extras/97238411503eb6ca39cd2fb7a406dbb8.avif?t=1752829356\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the culprit is revealed, they will face a punishment shaped by their own cognitive disorder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In a world consumed by distorted perceptions, will you uncover the real truth?</strong><br><i>Psycho-Sleuth</i> invites you to challenge twisted logic and confront pathological reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432860/extras/d46ed7cc0adf03bc410427323c93738c.poster.avif?t=1752829356\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432860/extras/d46ed7cc0adf03bc410427323c93738c.webm?t=1752829356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432860/extras/d46ed7cc0adf03bc410427323c93738c.mp4?t=1752829356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
